# Document definitions copied in by ndi_install.py from NDIcalc-vis-matlab
# (install_ndi_common_docs). These are that repo's files, regenerated by every
# install and by CI, so tracking them here would vendor a second copy that
# immediately starts drifting from the dependency that owns them. Scoped to the
# specific subtrees the installer writes -- the rest of database_documents/ and
# schema_documents/ is this repo's own and stays tracked. If NDIcalc-vis-matlab
# ever ships another subtree, add it here too.
src/ndi/ndi_common/database_documents/calc/
src/ndi/ndi_common/database_documents/neuro/
src/ndi/ndi_common/database_documents/vision/
src/ndi/ndi_common/schema_documents/calc/
src/ndi/ndi_common/schema_documents/neuro/
src/ndi/ndi_common/schema_documents/vision/
